                                "sense_id": "ea03b385-673f-3c96-aa67-fab6611da0b3",
                                "text": "The minister of state and I alike for booty ax,\nOnly I confess its priggings, v'ile he calls his swag a tax."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a8e63cc7-84f3-4ada-8d60-39c90b4b149f",
                                "sense_id": "ea03b385-673f-3c96-aa67-fab6611da0b3",
                                "text": "Vhy^([sic]), if I an't changed the coats without taking the priggings out ov my pocket, and have let him valk off vith all the plunder […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
